---
import { TECH_SPEC_URL } from "../consts";
---

<section class="section architecture">
  <div class="section-narrow arch-inner">
    <h2>Architecture</h2>
    <p>
      A producer thread runs DSP and writes interleaved stereo into a lock-free ring buffer. The
      audio callback only consumes — no allocations on the real-time thread.
    </p>
    <pre class="code-block" aria-label="Audio pipeline diagram"><code>Library / AudioSource
        │ load → PCM
        ▼
   Engine → decks + mixer (engine-dsp)
        │
        ▼
Producer thread ──► ring buffer ──► audio callback</code></pre>
    <p class="arch-link">
      <a href={TECH_SPEC_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the full tech spec on GitHub →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .architecture {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .arch-inner h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.875rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .arch-inner > p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .arch-link {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .arch-link a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .arch-link a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }
</style>
